00:33:35.980 --> 00:33:37.875
The other values I'd
write to Bigtable.

00:33:37.875 --> 00:33:40.000
So if you wanted to go back
and check your results,

00:33:40.000 --> 00:33:40.990
you just go to Bigtable.

00:33:40.990 --> 00:33:42.948
And then Bigtable, you
can do really fast index

00:33:42.948 --> 00:33:44.620
and range scan lookups.

00:33:44.620 --> 00:33:47.530
So here I'm writing
14 billion pieces

00:33:47.530 --> 00:33:49.360
