rows of information,

00:33:49.360 --> 00:33:51.670
to BigQuery at the end of this.

00:33:51.670 --> 00:33:54.580
So this is the pipeline running.

00:33:54.580 --> 00:33:56.224
It's now finished its work.

00:33:56.224 --> 00:33:57.640
I can know it's
