00:34:09.350 --> 00:34:11.300
I'm outnumbered.

00:34:11.300 --> 00:34:14.139
So I'm just going
to show the results

00:34:14.139 --> 00:34:15.320
as they landed in BigQuery.

00:34:15.320 --> 00:34:18.969
So this point is another point.

00:34:18.969 --> 00:34:21.969
When this finished,
there was no file

00:34:21.969 --> 00:34:25.989
