00:34:45.639 --> 00:34:48.400
which actually equates
to 1.6 terabytes of data.

00:34:48.400 --> 00:34:49.784
That's been loaded
in this table.

00:34:49.784 --> 00:34:51.909
And what I'm going to do--
not particularly smart--

00:34:51.909 --> 00:34:56.139
I'm just going to say, given
