00:34:56.139 --> 00:34:59.230
give me the max spot index
across all the scenarios.

00:34:59.230 --> 00:35:02.420
So when I run
this, it's actually

00:35:02.420 --> 00:35:04.910
going through and doing
a query against all the

00:35:04.910 --> 00:35:08.270
14 billion rows of information,
and I have my output.

00:35:08.270 --> 00:35:09.980
So right at the end,
you can actually

00:35:09.980 --> 00:35:13.340
start exploring your dataset,
or generating the reports

00:35:13.340 --> 00:35:15.830
that ultimately-- we're not
doing this all for fun, right.

00:35:15.830 --> 00:35:16.940
The bank is actually
running this

00:35:16.940 --> 00:35:18.410
and want reports
