there are parts,

00:40:32.260 --> 00:40:35.650
certainly within the code base
we were writing, that we could

00:40:35.650 --> 00:40:38.566
actually look at in
a more linear away

00:40:38.566 --> 00:40:40.190
from a parallel
processing perspective.

00:40:40.190 --> 00:40:42.086
And again, even when
