the more access me as a data

00:41:50.720 --> 00:41:55.040
engineer has to the
various functions

00:41:55.040 --> 00:41:56.870
and being able to
split them apart,

00:41:56.870 --> 00:41:58.490
the more I can try
and think of ways

00:41:58.490 --> 00:42:02.410
of optimizing the flow and the
parallelism within the system.

00:42:02.410 --> 00:42:05.510
So the more I can have
separate functions

00:42:05.510 --> 00:42:07.519
that I can pass
data to and from,

00:42:07.519 --> 00:42:08.810
the easier this becomes for me.

00:42:08.810 --> 00:42:11.390
And this gets another--
an interesting point

00:42:11.390 --> 00:42:13.160
that we found very
useful when we

00:42:13.160 --> 00:42:15.019
